                            <comment id="14547594" author="dmagda" created="Mon, 18 May 2015 06:25:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;In addition the same issue arises when portables are enabled. First time reproduced while was working on &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-471&quot; title=&quot;Change marshaller interface to work with ByteBuffer instead of byte array&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-471&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-471&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Affected tests. Test must be run in the following configuration IgniteGridGain-&amp;gt;Basic:&lt;br/&gt;
GridCacheOffHeapTieredPartitionedPortableEnabledFullApiMultiNodeSelfTest.testTransformSequentialOptimisticNoStart	&lt;br/&gt;
GridCacheOffHeapTieredPartitionedPortableEnabledFullApiMultiNodeSelfTest.testTransformSequentialOptimisticWithStart&lt;br/&gt;
GridCacheOffHeapTieredPartitionedPortableEnabledFullApiMultiNodeSelfTest.testTransformSequentialPessimisticNoStart&lt;br/&gt;
GridCacheOffHeapTieredPartitionedPortableEnabledFullApiMultiNodeSelfTest.testTransformSequentialPessimisticWithStart&lt;br/&gt;
GridCacheOffHeapTieredPartitionedPortableEnabledRollingUpdatesFullApiMultiNodeSelfTest.testTransformSequentialOptimisticNoStart&lt;br/&gt;
GridCacheOffHeapTieredPartitionedPortableEnabledRollingUpdatesFullApiMultiNodeSelfTest.testTransformSequentialOptimisticWithStart	&lt;br/&gt;
GridCacheOffHeapTieredPartitionedPortableEnabledRollingUpdatesFullApiMultiNodeSelfTest.testTransformSequentialPessimisticNoStart&lt;br/&gt;
GridCacheOffHeapTieredPartitionedPortableEnabledRollingUpdatesFullApiMultiNodeSelfTest.testTransformSequentialPessimisticWithStart&lt;br/&gt;
GridCachePortablePreloadIndexingOffheapTieredSelfTest.testPreloadAndQuery				&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
